{
 "endpoint": "/embeddings",
 "body": {
  "model": "openai/text-embedding-3-small",
  "input": "What does a change to billing-api need before it can merge?\n[2025-09-09] standup/boreal/2025-09-09: Changes to the billing API need a rollback plan attached to the pull request. [2026-05-26] handover/2026-05-26-billing-api: Ownership change: billing-api now sits with the Dune team. Boreal no longer owns it. [2025-09-08] standup/boreal/2025-09-08-2: New dependency for billing-api: feature-flags. Billing-api will gate the new invoice flow behind feature-flags; the reasoning is that the rollout needs a per-tenant kill switch. Boreal noticed that the notifier's request volume halved after the client rollout and pinged the owners.",
  "dimensions": 1536
 },
